(7515535, 1199582, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An amusing image that meets the challenge well.<br/> <br/>I like your humorous take on the challenge Marcel, it works well and congratulations on your HM well deserved. The person in costume really makes the image work, you must have paid them well! Your composition is good including the flooded table and seats really adds to the overall result. Thanks for the chuckle...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An amusing image that meets the challenge well. I like your humorous take on the challenge Marcel, it works well and congratulations on your HM well deserved. The person in costume really makes the image work, you must have paid them well! Your composition is good including the flooded table and seats really adds to the overall result. Thanks for the chuckle...', '2017-05-26 07:01:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515536, 1200157, 3306, '<td valign="top">Amazing. This challenge was meant for you. Congrats on your first blue ribbon.</td>', 'Amazing. This challenge was meant for you. Congrats on your first blue ribbon.', '2017-05-26 07:06:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515537, 1200155, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An landscape image that contributes to the challenge.<br/> <br/>I''m not really sure this fulfils the challenge brief, the cloudy sky is presumably the element that is meant to portray crummy weather but in actual fact that sky is really quite appealing and not, to me, indicative of bad weather. Everything also has a smudgily soft appearance, whether or not this is intentional it does not really add to the brief. In itself it is a pleasant enough landscape, thanks for your entry Janine</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An landscape image that contributes to the challenge. I''m not really sure this fulfils the challenge brief, the cloudy sky is presumably the element that is meant to portray crummy weather but in actual fact that sky is really quite appealing and not, to me, indicative of bad weather. Everything also has a smudgily soft appearance, whether or not this is intentional it does not really add to the brief. In itself it is a pleasant enough landscape, thanks for your entry Janine', '2017-05-26 07:09:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515538, 1200147, 3306, '<td valign="top">Still snow in Colorado! Great capture. I love it! Congrats on the well deserved  ribbon.</td>', 'Still snow in Colorado! Great capture. I love it! Congrats on the well deserved  ribbon.', '2017-05-26 07:10:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7515539, 1200133, 3306, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Thanks for sharing the story behind the shot. It is part of the fascination of the picture to know the story behind it. You are quite dedicated!</td>', 'Congrats. Thanks for sharing the story behind the shot. It is part of the fascination of the picture to know the story behind it. You are quite dedicated!', '2017-05-26 07:18:11.000000', NULL, 0),
